To install prerequisites:

sudo dnf install gtk3-devel zlib-static

To build deps:

* Make sure you have the commit which adds -Wno-error to +GMP/*cmake's configure step.

cd deps
mkdir build
cd build
cmake .. -DDEP_WX_GTK3=ON
# or maybe needed -compile-no-warning-as-error in the cmake command?
cd ../..

To build:

mkdir build
cd build
cmake .. -DSLIC3R_BUILD_TESTS=0 -DSLIC3R_STATIC=1 -DSLIC3R_GTK=3 -DSLIC3R_PCH=OFF -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=$(pwd)/../deps/build/destdir/usr/local
# cmake-devel doesn't compile!
make
